WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:05.000
Let him die? You are no longer pleading for his life?

00:06.000 --> 00:14.000
Yu Gong serves as Chancellor of the Imperial Academy; state policy falls outside his official jurisdiction. He may be found guilty of reckless interference and sentenced to decapitation!

00:14.840 --> 00:17.500
Good!

00:18.000 --> 00:27.000
Yet our dynasty has ever governed the realm through filial devotion. Yu Gong is an only son whose own child died in infancy; his aged father is now past seventy years old.

00:27.120 --> 00:37.400
Your son proposes we permit him to return home to care for his father in his final years. Once his father passes away, the execution shall then be carried out! Thus both loyalty and filial piety are satisfied, and all under heaven will praise Your Majesty's boundless virtue.

00:37.680 --> 00:44.400
Ha! "Both loyalty and filial piety satisfied"! Yet regarding his venomous personal slander against your own father, you don't utter a single syllable!
